  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Egypt Cybersecurity and Data Protection Workshop, through The Webster Group</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This contract funds a two-day workshop to support the Government of Egypt in developing best practices, conducting risk assessments, and identifying tools, regulations and protocols that support a robust cybersecurity program in Egypt that ensures data and infrastructure security. The Workshop would introduce delegates to U.S. companies, U.S. governmental regulators and agencies working in cybersecurity, and other stakeholders to discuss policies, regulations, and initiatives that can support a secure cyber environment in Egypt for the protection of sensitive information and critical infrastructure.</narrative>
  </description>
